{
  "name": "Forbidden Studies",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain Proficient in the Medicine skill. If you are already Proficient in the skill, you add double your Proficiency bonus to checks you make with it.</p><p>Additionally, you can target a friendly dying creature with Shocking Grasp to resuscitate it. If you hit, the attack does not count as a critical hit, but the target still suffers one Death Saving Throw failure. It then regains hit points equal to half the lightning damage done. This feature cannot target creatures that have already incurred two Death Saving Throw failures.</p>",
